<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Bloomingdale, Ill., GO bond deal.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Bloomingdale, Ill., GO bond deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Monday it qualified for bond insurance Bloomingdale, Ill.'s $14.54 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The deal is set to price at 1200 EDT Monday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
